  "The contrast in Messi's 2018 tournament is between receiving under close attention and escaping beyond the line. Against France he is forced to take the ball with his back to goal under Kanté's marking; against Nigeria he runs onto Banega's pass, controls with his thigh and left foot, then finishes with his right.": "El Mundial 2018 de Messi muestra un contraste entre recibir bajo una marca estrecha y escapar a la espalda de la última línea. Ante Francia debe recibir de espaldas bajo la vigilancia de Kanté; frente a Nigeria ataca el pase de Banega, controla primero con el muslo y luego con la zurda, y define con la derecha.",
